            "sid": "1CO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi ami nahoshaŋa madimi awantu nawaŋelu, ilaŋa nabula kukeŋa, neli dehi neyi mpùŋa yikuvuma, hela neyi nyishimpu yikuvuma ŋŋi-ŋŋi-ŋŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi neluka kuprofweta, neluka niyuma yakujinda yonsu, nima ana onsu; hela neyi ni kweti kukuhwelela kwonsu nikwakututulula nachu mapidi, ilaŋa nabula kukeŋa, niwamukunkulwayi tuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi nukuhana mahetami ejima nidiishi atuzweŋi, hela neyi nukuhana mujimba wami awochi, ilaŋa nabula kukeŋa, hichikunkwasha nihantuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukeŋa kwadiwunjikaŋa, kukweti niluwi; kukeŋa hikwahetaŋa ichimaku; kukeŋa hikwadinkaŋa wantaku; hikwaditoheshaŋaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hikwelaŋa chuma chabula kutelaku; hikwakokwelaŋa kwindi hohuku; hikwanyakalaŋa kuzuwaku; hikwafuukwilaŋa mukwawu chuma chatamaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hikwazaŋalalaŋa nayuma yabula kuloŋaku, kwazaŋalalaŋa nansaŋu yalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwovwahilaŋa yuma yejima, kwetejaŋa yuma yejima, kwachiŋejaŋa yuma yejima, kwatatakenaŋa mwahita yuma yejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukeŋa hikwakar; anyaloŋaku. Ilaŋa hela kuprofweta kwamba kahita; hela madimi eŋi amba kamwena; hela kwiluka kwamba kahita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa twelukaŋa hanti, twaprofwetaŋa nawa hanti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa chamba kashika chuma chalala chikupu, yuma yakumininamu yakahita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinadiŋi kansi nahoshelaŋa yawansi, natiyilaŋa mwawansi, natoŋojokelaŋa yawansi; ilaŋa hanu hinakuli dehi, naleki dehi yuma yawansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hanu tuchidi kumona muchibanjilu neyi mumbundu, ilaŋa henohu twamba kadimona mesu namesu; hanu neluka hanti, ilaŋa henohu nakeluka chikupu neyi chanapilukuwu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu kwekala kukuhwelela, nikuchiŋeja, nikukeŋa, yumiyi yisatu; chasweja kulema yowu kukeŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
